hadiths[44]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1776","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ibn Abi Fudaik ne hadees bayan ki, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Ibn Shihab se: Unhein pahunchi ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quraish ko aage rakho aur un se aage na badho; un se seekho aur un se ilm mein muqabla na karo, ya unhein na sikhlao. Ibn Abi Fudaik ko shak hua."
"1777","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Fudaik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Hakeem bin Abi Hakeem se: Unhon ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz aur Ibn Shihab ko kehte suna: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Quraish ko zaleel kare Allah Azza wa Jalla use zaleel karega."
"1778","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Fudaik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Haris bin Abdur Rahman se ke unhon ne farmaya: Hamein pahunchi ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar Quraish itraate na to main unhein woh batata jo un ke liye Allah Azza wa Jalla ke paas hai."
"1779","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Fudaik ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Shareek bin Abdullah bin Abi Namr se, Ata bin Yasar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quraish se farmaya: Tum is mamle ke sab logon se zyada haqdar ho jab tak tum haq ke sath ho, magar yeh ke tum us se hat jao to tum noch liye jaoge jaise nochi jati hai yeh khajoor ki tehni. Aap apne haath ki tehni ki taraf ishara farma rahe the."
"1780","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Sulaim ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Usman bin Khusaim se, Ismail bin Ubaid bin Rifa'ah Ansari se, apne walid se, apne dada Rifa'ah se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pukara: Aye logon, Quraish amanat wale hain. Jo un se laghzishon ka mutalba kare Allah Ta'ala use us ke nathnon ke bal gira dega. Aap ne ise teen baar farmaya."
"1781","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Yazid bin Hadh se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi se: Qatadah bin Nu'man ne Quraish ki burai ki, goya unhon ne un ki tauheen ki, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Thehro aye Qatadah, Quraish ko bura na kaho, kyunke shayad tum un mein se aise mard dekhoge, ya un mein se aise mard aayenge ke tum apne amal ko un ke aamal ke sath haqeer samjhoge aur apne fe'l ko un ke af'aal ke sath, aur jab tum unhein dekhoge to un par rashk karoge. Agar Quraish sarkashi na karte to main unhein woh batata jo un ke liye Allah Azza wa Jalla ke paas hai."
"1782","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se ek sanad ke sath jo mujhe yaad nahin: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quraish ke bare mein khair ki koi baat farmayi jo mujhe yaad nahin, unhon ne farmaya: Quraish ke bure, buron mein se achhe buron ki tarah hain. Yeh saaton hadeesein Kitab Ashribah wa Fazail Quraish se nikali, aur woh us mein sab se pehli hain."
"1783","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Darawardi ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab main ek kuen par pani kheench raha tha, pani pila raha tha. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Yani khwab mein, aur ambiya ke khwab wahi hain. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir Ibn Abi Quhafah aaye aur unhon ne ek ya do dol kheenche, aur un mein kamzori thi, aur Allah unhein bakhshe, phir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) aaye, aur kheenche yahan tak ke woh un ke haath mein bada dol ban gaya, phir logon ne hauz se pilaya. To main ne koi zaheen nahin dekha jo un ke kaam jaisa kaam kare. Kitab Ashribah wa Fazail Quraish se nikali, aur woh us mein aakhri hadees hai."
"1784","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansar mein se ek aadmi hota, aur agar log kisi wadi ya ghati mein chalte to main Ansar ki wadi ya un ki ghati mein chalta."
"1785","[AI-translation] Abdul Karim bin Muhammad Jurjani ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ibn Ghasil ne us aadmi se hadees bayan ki jis ka us ne naam liya, Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne marz mein nikle aur khutba diya. Phir Aap ne Allah Ta'ala ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Ansar ne woh ada kar diya jo un par tha, aur baqi raha jo tum par hai, pas un ke nekokar se qubool karo aur un ke badkar se darguzar karo. Aur Jurjani ne apni hadees mein farmaya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aye Allah, Ansar aur Ansar ke beton aur Ansar ke beton ke beton ko bakhsh de. Aur apni hadees mein farmaya: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab nikle to Ansar ki aurten aur bachche Aap ki taraf khushi se aaye; to Aap ko un par rehem aaya phir khutba diya, aur yeh baat farmayi. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ashribah wa Fazail Quraish se nikali."
"1786","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Hasan bin Muhammad se, Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein bheja, mujhe aur Zubair aur Miqdad ko, aur farmaya: Chalo yahan tak ke Raudhah Khakh pahuncho kyunke wahan ek musafir aurat hai jis ke paas khat hai. To hum nikle, hamare ghode hamein daudate hue le gaye, phir hum us musafir aurat ke paas the, to hum ne kaha: Khat nikalo. To us ne kaha: Mere paas khat nahin, to hum ne us se kaha: Tum zaroor khat nikalogi ya hum kapde utar phenkenge, to us ne use apni chotiyon se nikala, phir hum use Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laye, to us mein tha: Hatib bin Abi Balta'ah ki taraf se Makkah wale mushrikeen mein se chand logon ki taraf, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke baaz mamle ki khabar dete hue, to Aap ne farmaya: Aye Hatib, yeh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Mujh par jaldi na farmayen, main Quraish mein laga hua aadmi tha, aur un ke khaas mein se na tha, aur Muhajireen mein se jo Aap ke sath the un ke rishtedar the jo un ke zariye apne rishtedaron ki hifazat karte the, aur Makkah mein mera koi rishta na tha, to main ne chaha jab yeh mujh se fout ho gaya ke un ke paas ehsan karun, Allah ki qasam! Main ne yeh apne deen mein shak ki wajah se na kiya aur na Islam ke baad kufr se razi hone ki wajah se. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha hai. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, mujhe chhoden ke main is munafiq ki gardan maar dun. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh Badr mein shareek hua, aur tumhein kya maloom, shayad Allah ne Ahl Badr par nazar farmayi, aur farmaya: Jo chaho karo, main ne tumhein bakhsh diya, aur nazil hui: Aye iman walon! Mere dushman aur apne dushman ko dost na banao, un ki taraf dosti pahunchate hue (Al-Mumtahanah: 1). Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1787","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Hudaibiyah ke din ek hazaar chaar sau the, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum aaj zameen walon mein se behtareen ho. Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Agar main dekhta hota to tumhein us darakht ki jagah dikhata. Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhuma) mein nikali."
"1788","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Labeed se, Ibn Sulaiman bin Yasar se, apne walid se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Jabiyah mein khateeb ban kar khade hue, to unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan khade hue jaise main tumhare darmiyan khada hun, to Aap ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ki izzat karo phir un ke jo un ke baad hain phir un ke jo un ke baad hain. Phir jhoot zahir hoga yahan tak ke aadmi qasam khayega jabke us se qasam nahin mangi jayegi aur gawahi dega jabke us se gawahi nahin mangi jayegi. Khabardar! Jise jannat ke darmiyan mein rehna khush kare woh jamaat ko lazim pakde; kyunke shaitan akele ke sath hai, aur woh do se door hai, aur koi mard kisi aurat se tanhai na kare, kyunke shaitan un ka teesra hai, aur jise us ki neki khush kare aur us ki burai use ghamgeen kare woh momin hai. Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1789","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Tumhare paas Ahl Yaman aaye hain; woh sab se narm dil hain, aur sab se raqeeq dil wale, iman Yamani hai aur hikmat Yamani hai."
"1790","[AI-translation] Mere chacha Muhammad bin Ali bin Abbas ne hamein khabar di, Hasan bin Qasim Azraq se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Tabuk ki ghati par khade hue, to Aap ne farmaya: Yahan Shaam nahin hai, aur Aap ne apne haath se Shaam ki taraf ishara farmaya, aur yahan Yaman hai, aur Aap ne apne haath se Madinah ki taraf ishara farmaya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ashribah wa Fazail Quraish se nikali."
"1791","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Tufail bin Amr Dausi Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye, to bole: Aye Allah ke Rasool, Daus ne nafarmani ki aur inkar kiya, pas Allah se un par baddua farmayen. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qiblah ki taraf rukh farmaya aur haath uthaye, to logon ne kaha: Daus halaak ho gayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Aye Allah, Daus ko hidayat de aur unhein le aa. Kitab Ashribah wa Fazail Quraish se nikali."
"1792","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum logon ko kanon ki tarah paoge; un mein se jo jahiliyat mein behtar the woh Islam mein bhi behtar hain jab woh deen samjhen. Kitab Ashribah wa Fazail Quraish se nikali."
"1793","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Nauf Bikali ka khayal hai ke Khidr wale Musa Bani Israil wale Musa nahin. To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Allah ke dushman ne jhoot kaha, Allah ki qasam. Mujhe Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) ne khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein khutba diya. Phir unhon ne Musa aur Khidr ki hadees kuch aise bayan ki jo dalalat karti hai ke Musa Khidr wale hain. Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1794","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Salim Abun Nazr maula Umar bin Ubaidillah se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' ko apne walid se hadees bayan karte suna: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tum mein se kisi ko apne takht par tek lagaye hue na paun; us ke paas mere mamle mein se koi mamla aaye us mein se jo main ne hukm diya ya jis se main ne mana farmaya, to woh kahe: Mujhe nahin maloom, jo hum ne Allah ki kitab mein paya usi ki pairwi karenge."
"1795","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Muhammad bin Munkadir ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mursalan yahi hadees bayan ki. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Areekah takht hai."
"1796","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Salim Abun Nazr ne hadees bayan ki, Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' se, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tum mein se kisi ko apne takht par tek lagaye hue na paun; us ke paas mere mamle mein se koi mamla aaye us mein se jo main ne hukm diya ya jis se main ne mana farmaya, to woh kahe hamein nahin maloom, jo hum ne Allah ki kitab mein paya usi ki pairwi karenge."
"1797","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein ek sanad se khabar di: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log mujh par koi cheez na roken, kyunke main halal nahin karta magar woh jo Allah ne un ke liye halal farmaya aur main un par haram nahin karta magar woh jo Allah ne un par haram farmaya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Risalah se, teesri Kitab Yameen ma' Shahid se aur chauthi Kitab Sifat Amr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, aur woh us mein pehli hadees hai."
"1798","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Abi Amr maula Muttalib bin Hantab se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne koi cheez nahin chhodi us mein se jis ka Allah ne tumhein hukm diya magar main ne tumhein us ka hukm diya, aur main ne koi cheez nahin chhodi us mein se jis se Allah ne tumhein mana farmaya magar main ne tumhein us se mana farmaya, aur Roohul Ameen ne mere dil mein phoenka hai ke koi jaan nahin maregi yahan tak ke woh apna rizq poora kar le, pas talab mein khubsurti ikhtiyar karo. Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1799","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Aamir bin Sa'd se, apne walid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein Musalmanon ke haq mein sab se bade jurm wala woh hai jis ne kisi cheez ke bare mein poocha jo haram na thi, yani, phir woh us ke sawal ki wajah se haram kar di gayi."
"1800","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Aamir bin Sa'd se, apne walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi mani ki tarah."
"1801","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Ajlan se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe chhodo us par jo main ne tumhare liye chhoda. Kyunke tum se pehlon ko un ke kasrat sawal aur apne ambiya par ikhtilaf ne hi halaak kiya. Pas jo main ne tumhein kisi mamle ka hukm diya, us mein se jitna taqat rakho lao, aur jis se main ne tumhein mana farmaya to us se ruk jao."
"1802","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi mani ki tarah."
"1803","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Urwah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Qiyamat ke bare mein poocha jata raha yahan tak ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: Tumhein us ke zikr se kya (An-Nazi'at: 43). To Aap ruk gaye. Yeh chaar hadeesein Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur paanchwin Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1804","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se har Musalman ki khairkhwahi par bai'at ki."
"1805","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Suhail bin Abi Salih se, Ata bin Yazid Laisi se, Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deen nasihat hai, deen nasihat hai: Allah ke liye aur us ki kitab ke liye aur us ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye aur Musalmanon ke imamon aur un ke aam logon ke liye."
"1806","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, apne walid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us bande ko taro-taza rakhe jis ne meri baat suni phir use yaad rakha aur samjha aur ada kiya. Phir bahut fiqh uthane wala ghair faqeeh ki taraf aur bahut fiqh uthane wala us ki taraf jo us se zyada faqeeh hai. Teen cheezen hain jin par Musalman ka dil khayanat nahin karta: Allah Ta'ala ke liye amal mein ikhlas, Musalmanon ki khairkhwahi, aur un ki jamaaton ko lazim pakadna, kyunke un ki dua un ke peeche se ghere hue hai. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1807","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Darawardi ne khabar di, Muhammad bin Ajlan se, Abdul Wahhab bin Bukht se, Abdul Wahid Basri se, Wasilah bin Asqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Sab se badi iftara woh hai jo mujh par woh baat kahe jo main ne nahin kahi, aur jo apni aankhon ko khwab mein woh dikhaye jo unhon ne nahin dekha, aur jo apne baap ke siva ki taraf nisbat kare."
"1808","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo mujh par woh kahe jo main ne nahin kaha, woh apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"1809","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Sulaim ne hamein khabar di, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Abu Bakr se, Salim se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo mujh par jhoot bole us ke liye aag mein ghar banaya jayega."
"1810","[AI-translation] Amr bin Abi Salamah Tinnisi ne hamein khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Muhammad se, Usaid bin Abi Usaid se, apni walida se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abu Qatadah se kaha: Tumhein kya hai ke tum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees bayan nahin karte jaise log Aap se bayan karte hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Abu Qatadah ne farmaya: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo mujh par jaan-boojh kar jhoot bole, woh apne pehlu ke liye aag mein bistar bana le. Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yahi farmate rahe, aur apne haath se zameen par haath pherte rahe."
"1811","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bani Israil se hadees bayan karo aur koi harj nahin; aur mujh se hadees bayan karo aur mujh par jhoot na bolo. Yeh paanchon hadeesein Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1812","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe mere chacha Muhammad bin Ali ne khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Main hadees sunta hun aur use pasand karta hun; mujhe us ke zikr se koi cheez nahin rokti siwae is napasand ke ke koi sunne wala use sune aur us ki pairwi kare, main use us aadmi se sunta hun jis par mujhe bharosa nahin jis ne us se hadees bayan ki jis par mujhe bharosa hai, aur main use us aadmi se sunta hun jis par mujhe bharosa hai jis ne use us se bayan kiya jis par mujhe bharosa nahin. Aur Sa'd bin Ibrahim ne farmaya: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se siwae siqah logon ke koi hadees bayan na kare."
"1813","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah bin Umar ke bete se ek masle ke bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne us mein kuch na farmaya, to un se kaha gaya: Hum ise badi baat samajhte hain ke tum hidayat ke do imamon ke bete ho, tum se ek mamle ke bare mein poocha jaye jis mein tumhare paas ilm nahin. To unhon ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Is se badi baat Allah ke nazdeek aur us ke nazdeek jo Allah ko pehchanta hai aur us ke nazdeek jo Allah se samajhta hai yeh hai ke main woh kahun jis ka mujhe ilm nahin ya main ghair siqah se khabar dun."
"1814","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Idris ne farmaya: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sazaon aur un ke auqat ke bare mein mursal ahadees riwayat ki hain jinhein hum ne un ke munqati' hone ki wajah se chhod diya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Said waz Zabaih se, aur woh us mein aakhri hain, aur teesri Kitab Janaiz se, aur woh us mein aakhri hai."
"1815","[AI-translation] Rabi' ne farmaya: Main ne Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ko farmate suna: Abu Hanifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se us rozedar ke bare mein poocha gaya jo fajr nikalne tak khata, peeta aur suhbat kare, aur un ke paas ek shareef aadmi tha, to us ne kaha: Aap kya farmate hain agar fajr aadhi raat ko nikal aaye? To unhon ne farmaya: Khamosh raho aye langde."
"1816","[AI-translation] Main ne Rabi' bin Sulaiman ko kehte suna: Main ne Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ko farmate suna: Ilm talab karna nafl namaz se afzal hai."
"1817","[AI-translation] Main ne Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ko farmate suna: Agar Malik aur Sufyan na hote to Hijaz ka ilm chala jata."
"1818","[AI-translation] Asamm ne farmaya: Main ne Rabi' bin Sulaiman ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) jab farmate: Mujhe us ne khabar di jis par main shak nahin karta, to us se un ki murad Ibrahim bin Abi Yahya hote, aur jab farmate: Mujhe siqah ne khabar di, to us se un ki murad Yahya bin Hassan hote. Pehli Kitab Yameen ma' Shahid se, doosri Kitab Sadaq wal Ila se, teesri Kitab Said waz Zabaih se, aur chauthi Kitab Eidain se nikali."
"1819","[AI-translation] Asamm ne farmaya: Main ne Rabi' ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) do sau chaar mein Rajab ke aakhri din fout hue. Aur un ki umr ke bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne farmaya: Pachaas se kuch upar saal. Kitab Said waz Zabaih se nikali."
